WEBVTT

00:02.450 --> 00:03.930
I see.

00:03.930 --> 00:07.140
The restoration of your right 
to succeed the throne?

00:07.480 --> 00:11.790
Yes. I've been removed from my duties 
as princess for a long time,

00:11.790 --> 00:16.110
so I thought I should reintroduce 
myself to the spirit-faithful.

00:16.110 --> 00:19.250
I see! That is quite admirable.

00:19.250 --> 00:23.700
It seems our tomboy princess 
has settled down at last.

00:23.700 --> 00:27.920
Do you intend to assume the role 
of our future queen from now on?

00:28.600 --> 00:30.390
Yes... I do.

00:30.830 --> 00:32.210
Is she mad?

00:32.210 --> 00:36.130
We've never had a queen, much less 
a royal who couldn't use magic!

00:36.130 --> 00:39.090
The king isn't even forty years old yet.

00:39.090 --> 00:41.470
He could still produce 
a new heir if he tried.

00:41.470 --> 00:47.200
Yes, a king has an obligation to produce 
and raise his heir, for crying out loud!

00:47.680 --> 00:53.670
He must have some profound idea in mind 
that we lower classes could never fathom.

00:53.670 --> 00:54.900
Either that,

00:54.900 --> 00:58.850
or he just really wants 
Princess Anisphia to be queen.

01:00.730 --> 01:03.000
Regardless of what the king may be thinking,

01:03.000 --> 01:07.320
I intend to carry out my duties 
respectably as the next in line.

01:07.690 --> 01:10.830
I would greatly appreciate your cooperation.

01:12.720 --> 01:17.100
You have made your determination 
quite clear to us.

01:17.100 --> 01:19.890
We look forward to seeing how 
you conduct yourself henceforth.

01:20.640 --> 01:25.350
Yes. I humbly request your 
guidance and encouragement.

01:25.350 --> 01:26.820
Indeed.

01:27.430 --> 01:30.480
However, may I say just one thing?

01:31.660 --> 01:34.150
Your... "magicology," was it?

01:34.150 --> 01:35.910
It is unacceptable.

01:37.180 --> 01:42.600
To give magic, a blessing granted 
only to us, to mere commoners

01:42.600 --> 01:47.380
would render the authority of 
the nobility and royalty useless.

01:47.820 --> 01:49.820
Do you understand?

01:51.550 --> 01:53.460
No need for concern.

01:53.460 --> 01:57.140
The princess has always 
loved magic, after all.

01:58.900 --> 02:04.470
Which means she will need to think of a way 
to give magic to the next generation.

02:04.470 --> 02:07.960
Exactly. The royal family 
exists for the purpose

02:07.960 --> 02:10.320
of inheriting the gift of 
magic from the spirits.

02:10.560 --> 02:15.530
Meaning it would be ideal for the princess 
to produce an heir as soon as possible.

02:16.990 --> 02:20.000
In that case, we shall 
have to choose a partner

02:20.000 --> 02:22.700
close to her age from a high-ranking family.

02:23.060 --> 02:25.960
At this point, why prioritize status?

02:25.960 --> 02:29.210
We can just choose someone with 
an exceptional talent for magic.

02:29.210 --> 02:32.410
Then there's no need to worry 
about his age, either.

02:32.680 --> 02:36.730
Indeed. We should keep a 
few candidates on hand.

02:36.730 --> 02:41.680
Luckily, the princess seems 
to be in magnificent health.

02:44.840 --> 02:48.980
That said, I suppose internal stability 
should be our first priority.

02:48.980 --> 02:49.770
True.

02:49.770 --> 02:52.210
Yes, but we must waste no time...

03:07.410 --> 03:08.680
It's okay.

03:09.660 --> 03:11.390
I'm perfectly fine.

04:33.460 --> 04:42.010
The Magical Revolution

04:33.460 --> 04:42.010
The Magical Revolution

04:33.460 --> 04:42.010
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

04:45.430 --> 04:46.220
Here you go.

04:46.690 --> 04:47.930
Thank you.

04:49.690 --> 04:52.840
You've truly begun 
to look the part of a maid.

04:53.130 --> 04:55.460
I'm still in training...

04:55.460 --> 04:57.060
But I have you to thank, Miss Ilia.

04:57.060 --> 05:00.730
You have been an apprentice 
worth teaching, Lainie.

05:05.290 --> 05:10.650
Miss Anis, may I have some time 
to speak with you tomorrow?

05:12.710 --> 05:14.670
Ilia and Lainie, I'd like you there, as well.

05:19.170 --> 05:23.130
Um, I have Tilty's medical exam tomorrow...

05:27.690 --> 05:29.610
I'll reschedule it.

05:29.610 --> 05:31.220
Thank you.

05:32.010 --> 05:35.430
I've found what it is that I must do.

05:35.430 --> 05:40.800
And I want you, along with your father 
and mother, to hear it first.

05:54.190 --> 05:55.990
Ah, there you are, Anis.

06:00.440 --> 06:02.390
Father, who is she?

06:02.980 --> 06:05.430
Pleased to meet you, Your Highness.

06:05.430 --> 06:06.920
I'm Lumi.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.340
If I called myself a spirit contractor, 
would you understand?

06:09.340 --> 06:13.670
Huh?! But... what is a spirit 
contractor doing here?

06:15.510 --> 06:20.360
Your Majesties, thank you for making time 
to meet with me today.

06:20.710 --> 06:22.560
It's no bother at all.

06:22.980 --> 06:26.630
But I do wonder what it 
is you want to tell us...

06:32.550 --> 06:35.850
I have a favor I wish to ask of you.

06:35.850 --> 06:36.950
Uh-huh...

06:37.690 --> 06:41.930
Miss Lumi has determined that I meet the 
requirements to forge a spirit contract.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.870
What?!

06:47.660 --> 06:51.760
Huh? A s-spirit contract? Euphie?

06:51.760 --> 06:53.040
Yes.

06:53.040 --> 06:57.720
She is the only one in the world right now 
with the qualifications and will to do it.

06:58.400 --> 06:59.680
Are you serious?

07:01.770 --> 07:05.510
Even knowing the truth of what 
spirit contractors are?!

07:05.510 --> 07:06.320
Yes.

07:08.740 --> 07:13.540
Becoming a spirit contractor will make it 
difficult for you to live a normal life.

07:13.990 --> 07:16.370
What do you mean by that?

07:18.430 --> 07:20.510
How old does Miss Lumi look to you?

07:23.200 --> 07:26.370
How old? About the same as me?

07:26.960 --> 07:31.840
She still looks exactly the way 
she did when we first met her.

07:32.270 --> 07:33.840
That was decades ago.

07:35.110 --> 07:38.800
So spirit contractors... never age?

07:39.060 --> 07:43.010
Well, yes, but it's more than just that.

07:43.270 --> 07:47.060
In exchange for receiving great power, 
the contract dictates

07:47.060 --> 07:49.740
that you will eventually 
become a spirit yourself.

07:49.740 --> 07:51.980
You'll... become a spirit?

07:53.270 --> 07:57.850
My real name is Lumielle René Palettia.

07:57.850 --> 08:00.410
In other words, I'm your ancestor.

08:00.410 --> 08:03.120
Ancestor? You mean...

08:08.490 --> 08:10.790
I had a prince consort, too.

08:11.470 --> 08:14.570
He was a good man. A very good man.

08:15.620 --> 08:21.710
There were times when I wished 
I could live with him forever.

08:23.760 --> 08:24.940
But...

08:25.210 --> 08:29.990
The difference between our lifespans 
killed any hope of that.

08:30.800 --> 08:32.370
Once you become a spirit,

08:32.370 --> 08:35.850
all desires you had as a human disappear.

08:36.680 --> 08:40.350
There's no more need 
for memories or emotions.

08:42.130 --> 08:45.830
Can you imagine that? You forget <i>everything</i>.

08:46.490 --> 08:48.790
The way they smile at you in exasperation,

08:49.570 --> 08:51.760
the sound of their voice 
softly calling your name,

08:52.720 --> 08:55.240
the warmth you feel when 
they shyly touch you...

08:56.550 --> 08:58.630
You forget all of it.

09:04.680 --> 09:07.460
However you may try 
to preserve it all in writing,

09:07.460 --> 09:09.510
it only survives on paper.

09:10.410 --> 09:15.060
It becomes no more than a record 
with no feelings attached to it.

09:18.320 --> 09:21.030
You even forget that you forgot it.

09:22.490 --> 09:25.440
You lose your human body, your human life,

09:25.870 --> 09:28.940
and in time, even your human soul...

09:29.920 --> 09:32.590
and find yourself trapped 
in eternal solitude.

09:39.050 --> 09:43.050
That's... the truth of the spirit contract?

09:43.990 --> 09:47.100
Knowing that, do you still wish to forge one?

09:48.550 --> 09:53.580
Yes. The spirit contract 
is essential in fulfilling my wish.

09:54.900 --> 09:58.820
Your Majesty, once I have 
completed the spirit contract,

09:58.820 --> 10:02.110
I would like you to adopt me 
into the royal family

10:02.110 --> 10:04.790
and grant me the right 
to inherit the throne.

10:05.560 --> 10:06.240
What?

10:09.550 --> 10:12.370
W-Wait, wait! What are you saying?!

10:12.370 --> 10:15.290
Adopt you?! Why would you ask that?!

10:19.060 --> 10:21.380
Grantz! What's the meaning of this?!

10:21.380 --> 10:23.850
Why would Euphyllia ask such a thing?!

10:23.850 --> 10:26.070
I never gave her my blessing to ask this.

10:26.070 --> 10:29.970
But you know she isn't the type 
to take no for an answer.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.810
She <i>is</i> my daughter.

10:30.730 --> 10:33.630
Euphie... Why would you...

10:34.550 --> 10:38.410
Because I cannot allow you to become queen.

10:40.920 --> 10:42.530
Wh-Why not?

10:42.530 --> 10:44.670
What do you mean by that, Euphyllia?

10:45.070 --> 10:49.020
Miss Anis will never be accepted 
by the nobility of this kingdom,

10:49.020 --> 10:52.560
for the sole reason that 
she cannot use magic.

10:53.130 --> 10:56.630
And that's why you want me to 
give you the right to succeed?

10:59.460 --> 11:02.800
I acknowledge that you 
have remarkable talent.

11:02.800 --> 11:06.470
But even if we adopt you, that doesn't 
guarantee the nobles will accept you!

11:06.780 --> 11:09.420
That's what the spirit contract is for.

11:09.420 --> 11:12.580
If I achieve the same thing 
our founding king did,

11:12.580 --> 11:16.060
I can convince the spirit-faithful 
to accept me.

11:18.030 --> 11:20.220
Euphie, why?

11:20.740 --> 11:23.950
So that you won't have to be queen.

11:24.220 --> 11:27.920
Wait... Hang on! 
I never asked you to do this!

11:28.150 --> 11:32.560
I know. This is a promise 
that I made my own decision to fulfill.

11:32.970 --> 11:35.120
I don't want you to become queen.

11:36.030 --> 11:37.340
Are you serious about this?

11:42.370 --> 11:44.360
But you won't be human anymore!

11:44.360 --> 11:46.860
You'll lose everyone, forget everything,

11:46.860 --> 11:49.010
and be alone for the rest of eternity!

11:51.430 --> 11:53.250
You can't do that!

11:53.860 --> 11:56.850
I'd rather be queen than let you...

11:57.200 --> 12:04.080
Do you truly believe that you can 
lead this kingdom as its queen?

12:10.180 --> 12:14.530
You're right. I don't have 
the ability to use magic.

12:15.040 --> 12:18.500
And I know the nobles of this 
kingdom will never accept me.

12:18.920 --> 12:22.900
But that's no reason for you 
to take this upon yourself!

12:22.900 --> 12:25.380
Still, if I become queen,

12:25.380 --> 12:27.980
I'll be able to keep your dream alive.

12:28.300 --> 12:31.480
Don't you love magic and want to share it

12:31.480 --> 12:35.260
so that more people can understand 
how wonderful it is?!

12:35.590 --> 12:37.690
Wasn't that your dream?!

12:38.400 --> 12:40.660
My dream...

12:41.010 --> 12:43.850
I want you to achieve your dream.

12:43.850 --> 12:47.610
Your dream will bring 
prosperity to this kingdom.

12:48.140 --> 12:51.010
Please allow me to share 
your dream with you.

12:51.010 --> 12:55.580
For you to be free is my hope and wish.

12:57.590 --> 13:01.640
So, Miss Anis, please take my hand.

13:11.770 --> 13:13.010
No...

13:14.260 --> 13:16.470
Don't talk like that!

13:16.800 --> 13:18.600
Don't make me depend on you!

13:19.570 --> 13:20.650
Miss Anis?

13:21.070 --> 13:23.180
I'm the princess!

13:23.180 --> 13:26.870
Whether they accept me or not, 
I'm this kingdom's princess!

13:29.230 --> 13:31.890
If you take even that away from me...

13:33.310 --> 13:35.830
What value will I have left?

13:36.920 --> 13:38.480
Anis...

13:47.150 --> 13:48.780
Wait, Anis!

13:48.780 --> 13:50.090
Anisphia!

14:06.440 --> 14:08.530
What in the world are you doing?

14:11.890 --> 14:14.330
Tilty... Why...

14:14.550 --> 14:17.600
You're the one who told me 
to make a house call.

14:17.600 --> 14:21.210
Do you have any idea what a spectacle 
you're making of yourself?

14:21.210 --> 14:23.580
I could tell it was you 
from inside my carriage.

14:24.170 --> 14:26.160
Ugh, you're such a pain.

14:30.020 --> 14:31.110
Can you stand?

14:31.560 --> 14:32.410
Huh?

14:32.410 --> 14:35.710
What did I tell you? 
You're making a scene. Come on.

14:36.820 --> 14:37.640
Right...

14:53.400 --> 14:55.430
Go home once you've calmed down.

14:55.430 --> 14:57.660
Or should I call someone to come get you?

14:58.380 --> 15:00.540
Sorry. Don't do that.

15:00.540 --> 15:01.740
Not yet.

15:02.350 --> 15:04.010
What a pain...

15:04.410 --> 15:09.210
Aren't you supposed to just silently 
comfort me at times like this?

15:09.570 --> 15:12.030
What do you expect out of me?

15:12.030 --> 15:15.060
Go home before this blows up into 
a big mess. You're a nuisance.

15:15.930 --> 15:17.020
A nuisance...

15:19.360 --> 15:20.980
I'm sorry, okay?

15:21.430 --> 15:23.720
You're really throwing me off here...

15:27.600 --> 15:29.460
Stay as long as you want.

15:30.450 --> 15:31.300
Okay.

15:31.710 --> 15:34.250
But when someone comes for you, go home.

15:35.030 --> 15:36.160
Will anyone come?

15:37.770 --> 15:40.290
If they don't, you could 
just stay here, right?

15:41.610 --> 15:44.950
I'll hear you out, at least 
whenever I have the time.

15:52.500 --> 15:53.510
I see.

15:54.020 --> 15:57.760
I thought you didn't care about 
your right to the throne.

15:58.520 --> 16:00.210
I didn't care.

16:00.710 --> 16:02.990
But Al isn't around anymore.

16:02.990 --> 16:07.480
I'm the one who has to take on 
the responsibility of ruling.

16:08.430 --> 16:11.370
If I don't, I have no value as a princess.

16:11.810 --> 16:16.510
So how could she tell me I don't 
have to be queen after all this?

16:17.470 --> 16:19.620
But I have to give in.

16:20.140 --> 16:21.920
They'll never accept me.

16:23.450 --> 16:26.500
Why do you need them to accept you?

16:26.840 --> 16:27.570
Huh?

16:28.230 --> 16:31.800
A stupid father who dumps all the 
responsibility on his daughter...

16:31.800 --> 16:35.960
A bunch of stupid nobles who give thanks 
for some moldy old traditions...

16:35.960 --> 16:38.770
A stupid kingdom that 
doesn't appreciate you...

16:38.770 --> 16:41.430
Why do you need any of them to accept you?

16:42.260 --> 16:45.010
But... But still...

16:43.900 --> 16:45.640
Oh, come on...

16:53.810 --> 16:56.540
Why don't you just ditch this kingdom?

16:56.970 --> 16:59.080
Throw away your role 
and your right to the throne,

16:59.080 --> 17:02.870
and go somewhere completely 
different to study magic.

17:03.270 --> 17:05.740
You don't need to be here to do that, right?

17:07.270 --> 17:08.220
I can't.

17:08.490 --> 17:12.400
If you'd be missing any documents 
or materials, I can help you.

17:12.860 --> 17:15.880
It might be nice to travel 
to all kinds of places together.

17:16.290 --> 17:19.330
We could study the magic and curses 
they have in other countries,

17:19.780 --> 17:21.820
eat some delicious foods here and there,

17:22.210 --> 17:27.190
and maybe con some money out of 
evil nobles and corrupt merchants.

17:28.000 --> 17:29.810
That sounds nice.

17:32.060 --> 17:33.250
But we can't.

17:34.530 --> 17:36.570
I still can't throw it away.

17:36.570 --> 17:38.820
I can't throw away the fact 
that I'm a princess.

17:40.250 --> 17:41.180
I see.

17:42.970 --> 17:45.290
Tilty! Are you in there?

17:45.290 --> 17:46.720
If you are, please answer me!

17:47.200 --> 17:49.130
Someone came for you after all.

17:54.220 --> 17:55.130
Ready?

18:05.450 --> 18:06.220
Miss Anis...

18:09.000 --> 18:13.070
I'll leave the room. Tell me before you go.

18:13.070 --> 18:16.260
I'm very sorry for all the trouble.

18:24.560 --> 18:25.870
Just leave me alone.

18:26.400 --> 18:28.530
I can't do that!

18:37.280 --> 18:39.120
Why are you making that face?

18:39.980 --> 18:43.910
That's the first time you've 
expressed anger toward me.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.000
Huh?

18:47.940 --> 18:54.670
Being a princess was much more important 
to you than I realized, wasn't it?

19:03.380 --> 19:05.180
You're not fair, Euphie!

19:05.720 --> 19:08.320
I wanted the ability to use magic, too!

19:09.260 --> 19:13.980
Then I wouldn't have to lose 
anyone... or anything...

19:15.260 --> 19:19.000
Why do you have to deprive me 
of my role as princess <i>now</i>?!

19:19.590 --> 19:23.460
It's my duty... and it's all I have left!

19:24.020 --> 19:27.380
Even if no one approves 
or expects anything of me,

19:27.380 --> 19:29.430
I'm the princess of this kingdom!

19:29.760 --> 19:32.390
I'm the daughter of my mother and father!

19:33.460 --> 19:35.620
I can still keep trying hard...

19:36.360 --> 19:38.270
I can try harder!

19:38.270 --> 19:41.810
So don't make me someone nobody needs!

19:50.510 --> 19:53.950
It's okay. I'm perfectly fine.

19:55.300 --> 19:57.560
You're obviously not fine at all!

19:58.590 --> 20:01.350
Someone who values others before herself,

20:01.350 --> 20:03.310
who can't leave them on their own,

20:03.310 --> 20:06.200
who'd even sacrifice herself for them...

20:07.190 --> 20:10.780
To be rejected and hated by everyone...

20:11.690 --> 20:14.470
There's no way you're fine with that!

20:14.840 --> 20:16.110
Stop.

20:16.800 --> 20:19.010
None of this is your fault!

20:19.410 --> 20:24.150
This kingdom where you can't make anyone 
happy without magic is to blame!

20:24.150 --> 20:29.140
But even so, this is the kingdom that my 
mother and father wanted to protect!

20:29.540 --> 20:34.050
And all I can do is ruin that...

20:36.880 --> 20:39.130
But you have protected it.

20:39.520 --> 20:42.790
With the power of magic that 
you had more faith in than anyone.

20:43.280 --> 20:46.000
You care about this kingdom 
more than anyone,

20:46.000 --> 20:49.030
and you've fought for it 
by yourself all this time.

20:49.510 --> 20:51.830
Even without anyone's approval,

20:51.830 --> 20:56.410
you made your very own 
kind of magic a reality.

20:57.620 --> 21:02.200
You have my affirmation 
above all others, Miss Anis.

21:13.770 --> 21:16.580
It's okay now. You've done enough.

21:18.850 --> 21:20.240
<i>I can give up now.</i>

21:20.890 --> 21:24.380
<i>Euphie, the one I admire most 
of all, gave me her approval.</i>

21:24.960 --> 21:27.000
<i>That's more than rewarding enough.</i>

21:27.600 --> 21:29.050
Miss Anis?

21:29.470 --> 21:33.310
I still can't do it. 
I don't want to sacrifice you.

21:33.770 --> 21:37.730
My dream can't even begin 
to compare to your life.

21:38.000 --> 21:39.440
But—

21:40.830 --> 21:43.590
I know you won't back down,

21:43.590 --> 21:46.150
I know how you feel, 
and I know what you're saying.

21:48.850 --> 21:50.830
So... let's have a duel.

21:52.890 --> 21:56.000
That's how you can convince me.

22:01.250 --> 22:02.490
Very well.

22:02.500 --> 22:05.010
Episode Eleven







The Spirit Contract of Despair and Determination

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
Episode Twelve







Their Magical Revolution
